# NOTE: desktop installers are deliberately NOT part of this repo or its build
# output. They are published by Bliss-Work's release.yml to
# /home/ubuntu/BlissWork/downloads on the VPS and served at /downloads/* by
# nginx. They previously lived in public/downloads + dist/downloads, which meant
# every `npm run build` deleted the entire installer set. Do not reintroduce
# either directory.
